<p>Ahle aza me Sibte Payambar ka hai matam,<br>
Zehra ke pisar warese Haider ka hai matam.</p>

<p>Ek kafera ne zehre sitam tha pila diya,<br>
Masmoom ibne Saqiye Kousar ka hai matam.</p>

<p>Tukde dilo jigar ke gire farshe qaak par,<br>
Qasim yateem hogaye Shabbar ka hai matam.</p>

<p>Ahle haram bhi rote hai aur qaak udhate hai,<br>
Kya bekasou ke moniso yawar ka hai matam.</p>

<p>Zainab yeh roke kehti hai bhai ki laash par,<br>
Mazloome Karbala ke biradar ka hai matam.</p>

<p>Dushman ke teer laash pe chalte hain haye haye,<br>
Ruhe Batool roti hai dilbar ka hai matam.</p>

<p>Pehlu me jab nawase ko madfan na milsaka,<br>
Larza'n Nabi ki qabr hai Shabbar ka hai matam.</p>

<p>'Qasim' bhi sogwar hai karta hai shor o shain,<br>
Sab momino ke haadi o rehbar ka hai matam...</p>